# Words to never translate, one per line, case-insensitive.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Use this for proper nouns and identifiers that happen to look like British
# spellings: organization names, product names, cited titles, API fields.
#
# Examples (uncomment or add your own):
# labour          # e.g. "Labour Party"
# centre          # e.g. "Wellcome Centre", "Centre Pompidou"
# defence         # e.g. "Ministry of Defence"
# behaviour       # e.g. a third-party API field named `behaviour`
